# Part 5: Azure App Service kya hai?

Ab Azure Container Apps samajh aa gaya.

Ab Azure App Service dekhte hain.

Azure App Service ek fully managed PaaS platform hai jahan hum:

- Web Applications
- REST APIs
- Mobile Backends

host kar sakte hain.

Azure underlying infrastructure aur hosting platform manage karta hai.

Humein manually server, operating system aur web hosting infrastructure manage karne ki zaroorat nahi hoti.

## 10. Azure App Service mein application deploy kaise karte hain?

Azure App Service mein generally do deployment options samajhne chahiye.

### Option 1: Code Deployment

Maan lo humare paas ek ASP.NET Core Web API hai.

Hum application publish karke uski files Azure App Service par deploy kar sakte hain.

```text
.NET Web API Project
        |
        v
   dotnet publish
        |
        v
 Published Files
        |
        v
 Azure App Service
        |
        v
 Running Web API
```

Is approach mein apni custom Docker Image banana compulsory nahi hai.

Azure selected runtime stack ke according application host karta hai.

### Option 2: Container Deployment

Azure App Service custom Docker Image deployment bhi support karta hai.

Example:

```text
.NET Web API Project
        |
        v
   Docker Build
        |
        v
 ProductService Image
        |
        v
 Azure Container Registry
        |
        v
 Azure App Service
        |
        v
 Running Container
```

Matlab Azure App Service mein bhi Docker Image deploy kar sakte hain.

**Important:**

App Service sirf non-Docker applications ke liye nahi hai. Ye code deployment aur custom container deployment dono support karta hai.

## 11. App Service Plan kya hota hai?

App Service Plan underlying compute resources provide karta hai jahan Web Apps run hoti hain.

Example:

```text
               App Service Plan (B1)
                        |
          ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
          |             |             |
          v             v             v
    ProductService  OrderService  UserService
      Web App         Web App      Web App
```

Yahan:

- One App Service Plan.
- Three separate Web Apps.
- Teeno Web Apps independently deploy aur configure ho sakti hain.
- Teeno same App Service Plan ki compute capacity share kar sakti hain.

### Important distinction

App Service Plan aur App Service same cheez nahi hain.

**App Service Plan:**

Compute capacity aur hosting resources provide karta hai.

**App Service / Web App:**

Individual application hoti hai jo App Service Plan par host hoti hai.

### App Service ke andar multiple APIs host kar sakte hain?

Technically, yes.

Ek Web App ke andar multiple endpoints ya APIs ek hi ASP.NET Core application ka part ho sakte hain.

Lekin agar ProductService, OrderService aur UserService ko independently deploy aur manage karna hai, toh normally separate Web Apps create karenge.

