# Part 8: Kab kaunsa use karna chahiye?

## Azure App Service choose karo jab:

- Normal ASP.NET Core Web API ya MVC application host karni ho.
- Simple deployment chahiye.
- Visual Studio ya GitHub se straightforward deployment karna ho.
- Advanced container scaling ki requirement nahi ho.
- Managed web application hosting chahiye.

## Azure Container Apps choose karo jab:

- Application already Dockerized ho.
- Multiple microservices independently deploy karni ho.
- Har microservice ko independently scale karna ho.
- Background workers run karne ho.
- RabbitMQ ya Azure Service Bus jaise event sources par scaling chahiye.
- Scale-to-zero aur revision-based deployment chahiye.
- Kubernetes cluster khud manage nahi karna ho.

## Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) kab?

Jab humein Kubernetes par direct control chahiye.

For example:

- Kubernetes Deployments
- Pods
- Services
- Ingress
- ConfigMaps
- Secrets
- Cluster-level networking
- Advanced orchestration

AKS mein Azure control plane manage karta hai, lekin humein Kubernetes workloads aur worker node resources manage karne padte hain.

