# Final Summary – Remember These Concepts

| Term | Meaning |
|---|---|
| Docker Image | Application ka packaged version |
| Docker Container | Docker Image ka running instance |
| Container Apps Environment | Multiple Container Apps ka shared environment |
| Container App | Individual deployed containerized application |
| Replica | Same application version ka running instance |
| Revision | Application ka specific deployed version/configuration |
| App Service Plan | Web Apps ke liye shared compute capacity |
| App Service | Individual hosted web application |
| AKS | Azure managed Kubernetes service |

## Most Important Difference

**Azure App Service:**

Managed web application hosting platform hai. Ismein hum direct .NET code ya custom Docker Image deploy kar sakte hain.

**Azure Container Apps:**

Managed container hosting platform hai. Ismein hum Docker Images deploy karte hain aur har Container App ko independently scale kar sakte hain.

**AKS:**

Managed Kubernetes service hai jahan humein Kubernetes workloads aur cluster-level configurations par direct control milta hai.

